  "contentHtml": "<p>올해는 학교 예산으로 부탁드렸더니,&#160;</p><p>실물이 아니라 과학과 예산도 불가하고,&#160;</p><p>혼자만 사용하는거라 정보부 소프트웨어 예산도 안된다고 거절당하였습니다.&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>유효기간 만료 전 녹화 떴습니다.</p><p>해수면 변화가 되면 우리나라의 서쪽이 없어진다는게 충격이네요..ㅠㅠ</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rv16lyu92o65nc167bxbybgew@my?service=daum_cafe\" data-video-host=\"kakaotv\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"712\" data-video-height=\"400\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://thumb.kakaocdn.net/dna/kamp/source/rv16lyu92o65nc167bxbybgew/thumbs/4.jpg?credential=TuMuFGKUIcirOSjFzOpncbomGFEIdZWK&amp;expires=33207253447&amp;signature=vO8Epn1V8Xpv3ygBjKHpYFxfwEE%3D\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthFull\" data-video-origin-width=\"712\" data-video-origin-height=\"400\"><iframe src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rv16lyu92o65nc167bxbybgew?service=daum_cafe&amp;f=p&amp;ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InJ2MTZseXU5Mm82NW5jMTY3YnhieWJnZXciLCJ0aWQiOiIwOTYxYWU4Mi1lODhjLTQ1MzAtODc1Yi1hNzZkOWM0OTdmOTciLCJhcHBfaWQiOiJkYXVtX2NhZmUiLCJleHAiOjE3ODYxODU5NzZ9.OcQK3y7cTfJExqn0ApZDPs4p5QLxo1J4XQN-y4I-Rd0kft-umCdPBQge21P6lt4DR8iiW0aiPZxZWROhp4tiEA&amp;autoplay=0\" width=\"712\" height=\"400\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\" allow=\"encrypted-media\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvq5rqx859k7rwnq7744vcyay@my?service=daum_cafe\" data-video-host=\"kakaotv\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"712\" data-video-height=\"400\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://thumb.kakaocdn.net/dna/kamp/source/rvq5rqx859k7rwnq7744vcyay/thumbs/3.jpg?credential=TuMuFGKUIcirOSjFzOpncbomGFEIdZWK&amp;expires=33207253497&amp;signature=Jzvcx1FsGKr3dQ4Fk4ZTzpD%2Bydk%3D\" data-k